---
import { HeroVisual } from "@/components/hero-visual";
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 grid-bg pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 gradient-glow pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="container-page relative pt-16 pb-20 md:pt-28 md:pb-32">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <a
        href="https://github.com/sachncs/agent-guard/releases"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex animate-in-up items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-inset)] px-3 py-1 text-xs text-[var(--fg-muted)] transition-all hover:border-[var(--border-strong)] hover:text-[var(--fg)]"
      >
        <span class="relative flex size-1.5">
          <span class="absolute inset-0 animate-ping rounded-full bg-[var(--accent)]/60"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--accent)]"></span>
        </span>
        Open source · Cedar 4.x · AuthZEN-compatible PDP
      </a>

      <h1
        class="display mt-6 text-balance text-5xl leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-[var(--fg)] animate-in-up delay-100 sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl"
      >
        Authorization for
        <span class="display italic text-[var(--accent)]"> AI agents </span>
        you can verify.
      </h1>

      <p
        class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-pretty text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--fg-muted)] animate-in-up delay-200 sm:text-lg"
      >
        Put a clear, inspectable authorization boundary before every tool call. Use Cedar
        policies, tamper-evident audit, and scoped delegation through the CLI, HTTP PDP,
        TypeScript SDK, or embedded Rust engine.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 animate-in-up delay-300 sm:flex-row">
        <a
          href="https://github.com/sachncs/agent-guard#quick-start"
          class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--accent)] px-7 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--accent-fg)] shadow-[var(--shadow-cedar)] transition-all hover:brightness-110"
        >
          Get started
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="size-4"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a
          href="#how"
          class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] bg-[var(--bg-inset)] px-7 text-sm font-medium text-[var(--fg)] transition-all hover:border-[var(--border-strong)]"
        >
          How it works
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2 text-xs text-[var(--fg-subtle)] animate-in-up delay-400">
        <span>Apache-2.0</span>
        <span class="text-[var(--border-strong)]">·</span>
        <span>Rust 1.89+</span>
        <span class="text-[var(--border-strong)]">·</span>
        <span>Node.js 20.9+</span>
        <span class="text-[var(--border-strong)]">·</span>
        <span>Zero proprietary protocols</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative mx-auto mt-20 max-w-5xl animate-in-up delay-500 md:mt-28">
      <HeroVisual client:visible />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
